Changing an existing key prints a unified diff of the file on stdout, with --- / +++ / @@ headers.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
sp: 5
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=ready-for-dev
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: draft
+status: ready-for-dev
 sp: 5
 ---
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=ready-for-dev
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: ready-for-dev
sp: 5
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
